OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy, dull start with
OL,6,Fperhaps the odd spot of rain. Skies
OL,7,Fgradually brighten in places,
OL,8,Fespecially west of high ground, with
OL,9,Fsome sunshine developing. Temperatures
OL,10,Fnear average but feeling rather cool
OL,11,Fin the easterly breeze.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining rather cloudy
OL,14,Fovernight with perhaps some rain
OL,15,Freaching parts of Cornwall and south
OL,16,FDevon at times. Staying breezy helping
OL,17,Fto keep temperatures from falling too
OL,18,Flow.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
