OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FAnother largely cloudy day
OL,6,Ffor many, although some sunshine
OL,7,Fdeveloping towards the west. Still the
OL,8,Frisk of some spots of rain,
OL,9,Fparticularly along the south coast.
OL,10,FEasterly breeze gradually easing.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FStaying
OL,13,Foften cloudy throughout Friday and the
OL,14,Fweekend. The risk of some showery rain
OL,15,Fat times, especially towards Devon and
OL,16,FCornwall on Friday and Saturday.
OL,17,FTemperatures remaining near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
